---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Soha Sami"
  description="About Soha Sami, working across energy markets, quantitative finance and climate risk."
  active="about"
>

  <main class="about-page">

    <section class="about-hero shell">
      <div class="about-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>

        <h1>Soha Sami</h1>

        <p class="about-lead">
          Energy markets · Quantitative finance · Climate risk
        </p>

        <div class="about-copy">
          <p>
            I’m Soha, a graduate student working across energy markets,
            quantitative finance and climate risk.
          </p>

          <p>
            My academic path has taken me from Economics and Mathematics in
            New Delhi to Bologna, Munich and Paris through the Erasmus Mundus
            GrEnFin programme.
          </p>

          <p>
            Moving between different academic environments has shaped how I
            approach questions around energy, finance and climate-related
            change, combining economic reasoning with quantitative methods.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-photo">
        <img
          src="/website/images/soha-profile.png"
          alt="Soha Sami"
        />
      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="about-section shell">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">EDUCATION</p>
        <h2>From New Delhi to Europe</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="education-grid">

        <article class="education-card">
          <p class="education-location">New Delhi · India</p>

          <h3>University of Delhi</h3>

          <p class="degree">
            BA Economics &amp; Mathematics · 2021–2025
          </p>

          <p>
            My undergraduate studies gave me a foundation in economics,
            mathematics, statistics and quantitative analysis.
          </p>
        </article>


        <article class="education-card">
          <p class="education-location">Bologna · Italy</p>

          <h3>Università di Bologna</h3>

          <p class="degree">
            MSc Greening Energy Market and Finance
          </p>

          <p>
            Bologna was the first stage of my GrEnFin programme, where I
            developed my understanding of European energy markets and the
            economic and financial questions surrounding them.
          </p>
        </article>


        <article class="education-card">
          <p class="education-location">Munich · Germany</p>

          <h3>LMU Munich</h3>

          <p class="degree">
            MSc Financial and Actuarial Mathematics
          </p>

          <p>
            At LMU, I strengthened my quantitative background through
            financial mathematics, stochastic modelling, quantitative risk
            management and numerical methods.
          </p>
        </article>


        <article class="education-card current">
          <p class="education-location">Paris · France</p>

          <h3>Université Paris Dauphine-PSL</h3>

          <p class="degree">
            MSc Economics and Finance
          </p>

          <p>
            I am currently in Paris, where my GrEnFin studies include
            Climate &amp; Business. This stage has broadened my perspective
            on climate-related questions, business and finance.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="journey-section">
      <div class="shell journey-grid">

        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">THE JOURNEY</p>

          <h2>
            Four cities.<br />
            One evolving research focus.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="journey-copy">
          <p>
            I started my academic life in <strong>New Delhi</strong> and
            moved to Europe for GrEnFin. Since then, I have lived and
            studied in <strong>Bologna, Munich and Paris</strong>.
          </p>

          <p>
            Living in three countries has given me a closer view of the
            European energy and finance landscape. The questions may be
            shared across Europe, but the way they are discussed and
            studied can differ significantly between countries.
          </p>

          <p>
            That perspective has become an important part of how I approach
            research, particularly when looking at energy markets,
            financial risk and climate-related change.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="about-section shell">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH INTERESTS</p>

        <h2>What I study</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="focus-grid">

        <article class="focus-card">
          <h3>Energy markets</h3>

          <p>
            Electricity markets, market design, power prices, renewable
            generation, flexibility and uncertainty in European power
            systems.
          </p>
        </article>


        <article class="focus-card">
          <h3>Quantitative finance</h3>

          <p>
            Stochastic modelling, quantitative risk management, financial
            mathematics, numerical methods and computational approaches
            to financial problems.
          </p>
        </article>


        <article class="focus-card">
          <h3>Climate risk</h3>

          <p>
            Physical and transition risks, climate-related financial risk
            and the effects of climate change on markets, firms and
            financial decision-making.
          </p>
        </article>


        <article class="focus-card">
          <h3>Research &amp; computation</h3>

          <p>
            Using Python, statistics and quantitative methods to investigate
            questions around energy, finance and climate-related change.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="currently-section shell">
      <div class="currently-card">

        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">CURRENTLY</p>
          <h2>Based in Paris</h2>
        </div>

        <p>
          I am currently studying at Université Paris Dauphine-PSL,
          continuing my GrEnFin journey while developing my interests in
          energy markets, quantitative finance and climate risk.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

</BaseLayout>


<style>
  .about-page {
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .about-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(280px, 0.85fr);
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 6rem;
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
  }

  .about-intro {
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .about-intro h1 {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.65rem;
    color: var(--green-950);
  }

  .about-lead {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    color: var(--green-600);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-copy {
    max-width: 660px;
  }

  .about-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 1.15rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-copy p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-photo {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .about-photo img {
    width: min(350px, 100%);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 9px solid var(--paper-2);
    outline: 2px solid var(--green-800);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(6, 37, 27, 0.14);
  }


  .about-section {
    padding-top: 5.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 5.5rem;
  }

  .section-heading {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .section-heading h2 {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    color: var(--green-950);
  }


  .education-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .education-card {
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 22px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(6, 37, 27, 0.045);
  }

  .education-card.current {
    background: var(--green-900);
    border-color: var(--green-900);
  }

  .education-location {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    color: var(--green-600);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .education-card.current .education-location {
    color: var(--lime);
  }

  .education-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
    color: var(--green-950);
  }

  .education-card.current h3 {
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .education-card .degree {
    margin: 0 0 1.15rem;
    color: var(--green-800);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .education-card.current .degree {
    color: var(--lime);
  }

  .education-card > p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .education-card.current > p:last-child {
    color: rgba(251, 252, 247, 0.82);
  }


  .journey-section {
    background: var(--green-900);
    padding: 6rem 0;
  }

  .journey-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .journey-section h2 {
    margin: 0.45rem 0 0;
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .journey-copy {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .journey-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    color: rgba(251, 252, 247, 0.82);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .journey-copy p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .journey-copy strong {
    color: var(--lime);
  }


  .focus-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .focus-card {
    min-height: 200px;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--paper-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 22px;
  }

  .focus-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    color: var(--green-900);
  }

  .focus-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }


  .currently-section {
    padding-top: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 6.5rem;
  }

  .currently-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    background: var(--green-800);
    border-radius: 24px;
  }

  .currently-card h2 {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .currently-card > p {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(251, 252, 247, 0.86);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }


  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about-hero,
    .journey-grid,
    .currently-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .about-hero {
      padding-top: 4.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 4.5rem;
    }

    .education-grid,
    .focus-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-photo {
      order: -1;
    }

    .about-photo img {
      width: 260px;
    }
  }
</style>
